** sch_path: /work/input/nl14.sch
**.subckt nl14
x1 N1 N2 missing
x2 N1 N2 withdef
x3 N1 N2 stopped
x4 N1 N2 ignored
**.ends

* expanding   symbol:  missing.sym # of pins=2
** sym_path: /work/input/missing.sym
** sch_path: /work/input/missing.sch
.subckt missing A B
.ends


* expanding   symbol:  withdef.sym # of pins=2
** sym_path: /work/input/withdef.sym
.include x.spice

* expanding   symbol:  stopped.sym # of pins=2
** sym_path: /work/input/stopped.sym
** sch_path: /work/input/stopped.sch
.subckt stopped A B
.ends

.end
